/target
.DS_Store
# The npm package's build output and its dependencies. `javascript/dist/` is `tsc`'s
# emit plus jco's transpile copied beside it, `javascript/src/wasm/` is that transpile,
# and `javascript/test/generated/` is the corpus bundled as a module — all three are
# produced by `make check-js` and none of them is a source.
/javascript/node_modules
/javascript/dist
/javascript/src/wasm
/javascript/test/generated
/javascript/.tsbuild-examples
/javascript/*.tgz
